      "guide": [],
      "explanation": "The password deadline remains last change plus maximum age. Only the inactivity field changes, so the requirement to change a password remains during the authorized 7 day grace. At its exact end the pinned model returns grace ended. Removing maximum age or changing the recorded last change would hide the problem rather than repair it.",
      "hints": [
        "List river and compare Password expires with Password inactive.",
        "The requested field is capital -I. It counts days after expiry, not after the last login.",
        "Keep the maximum and last-change date. Check the first expired day and the exact end of grace separately."
      ],
      "sources": [
